/*
:name: spec_syntax_destructure_no_field
:type: error
:error: unknown field `y`
*/
// qa.md Appendix §8: "destructuring a NAMED tuple binds each bare slot by name match (slot
// name == field name) or `slot=field`; ... a bare slot whose name matches no field of a named
// RHS is an error" (docs 03-bundle.md: `(y, x) = dox(a=3)  // error: `y` is not a field`).
comb dox(a) -> (b, c) { b = a + 1; c = a + 2 }
mut y = 0
mut x = 0
(y, x) = dox(a=3)   // locate_error_here
